  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 36 - 9 × 15 + 8 ÷ 3 = 65\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) + and ×\n\n36 - 9 × 15 + 8 ÷ 3 = 65 ⇒ 36 - 9 + 15 × 8 ÷ 3 = 65\n\n⇒ 36 - 9 + 15 × __**8 ÷ 3**__ = 65\n\n⇒ 36 - 9 + __**15 × 2.67**__ = 65\n\n⇒ __**36 + 40**__ - 9 = 65\n\n⇒ __76____** - 9**__ = 65\n\n⇒ 67 ≠ 65 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ and ×\n\n36 - 9 × 15 + 8 ÷ 3 = 65 ⇒ 36 - 9 ÷ 15 + 8 × 3 = 65\n\n⇒ 36 - __**9 **____**÷**____** 15**__ + 8 × 3 = 65\n\n⇒ 36 - 0.6 + __**8 × 3**__ = 65\n\n⇒ __**36 + 24**__ - 0.6 = 65\n\n⇒ __60____** - 0.6**__ = 65\n\n⇒ 59.4 ≠ 65 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) − and ÷\n\n36 - 9 × 15 + 8 ÷ 3 = 65 ⇒ 36 ÷ 9 × 15 + 8 - 3 = 65\n\n⇒ __**36 ÷**____** 9**__ × 15 + 8 - 3 = 65\n\n⇒ __**4**____** × 15**__ + 8 - 3 = 65\n\n⇒ __**60**____** + 8**__ - 3 = 65\n\n⇒ __6____8** - 3**__ = 65\n\n⇒ **65 ****= **65** (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) − and +\n\n36 - 9 × 15 + 8 ÷ 3 = 65 ⇒ 36 + 9 × 15 - 8 ÷ 3 = 65\n\n⇒ 36 + 9 × 15 - __**8 ÷ 3**__ = 65\n\n⇒ 36 + __**9 × 15**__ - 2.67 = 65\n\n⇒ __**36 + 135**__ - 2.67 = 65\n\n⇒ __271** - 2.67**__ = 65\n\n⇒ 268.33 ≠ 65 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
